  "stakes": {
    "do": "Cut across instead of going around. Find Ingrid Lindqvist's dye plant, which only grows in this stretch, and Artemisia Falk's hawk, which is down in it somewhere.",
    "lose": "Stock and hands after dark. The Second Shadow hunts here at night and is the reason this is a place you cross in daylight.",
    "decide": "Whether the hours saved cutting through are worth being caught in the timber at dusk."
  },
  "art_gap": "Reads as mixed timber and grass, which is honestly close to correct: this is the location the existing art suits best. Needs weather, because the place is defined by a storm arriving and there is no sky."
